  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAABU Produce Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Maize .Beneficiaries: 2,518 smallholder farmers of whom 1,423 are women...Project funds will be used to establish Taabu as a one-stop-center for aggregation of produce (maize, beans and coffee), supply of farm inputs to farmers and provider of quality produce to buyers. The project will provide a structure for maize mill, dryer and cleaner as well as provide value addition equipment. Some project funds will be used to provide various trainings, technical assistance and administrative support. .</narrative>
  </description>
